  "captions": {
    "tiktok": "Asked for contemporary. Got Chekhov. Again. Ghost Light found David Auburn, Gil Kofman and Don Zolidis. The voice is AI. #monologue #audition #actorslife #actortok #theatrekid",
    "youtube_title": "Asked for contemporary. Got Chekhov. Again. #shorts",
    "youtube_description": "Asked for contemporary. Got Chekhov. Again.\nMilo asked the librarian for something written this century and got The Seagull, then Ibsen, then the Complete Shakespeare. In Ghost Light he typed what he needed and up came Are You Ready? by David Auburn, American Magic by Gil Kofman and The Audition by Don Zolidis. Free on the App Store. Built by a working actor. The voice is AI.\n#monologue #audition #actorslife #acting",
    "instagram": "Asked for contemporary. Got Chekhov. Again.\n\nWho else has been handed The Seagull when they asked for something written this century?\n\nWhat Milo typed in Ghost Light: contemporary theatre monologue for a woman in her twenties. What came up: Are You Ready? by David Auburn, American Magic by Gil Kofman, The Audition by Don Zolidis.\n\nFree on the App Store, built by a working actor. Link in bio. The voice is AI.\n\n#monologue #audition #actorslife #actorsofinstagram #contemporarytheatre"
  },
